title The startup thesis, tested stage by stage (research of 2026-09-26)
* WaslaBid as a venture-scale startup?
** 1. Tender SaaS wedge <<green>>
*** Real gap; SAR 10M to 20M company by year 5 (document 11) <<note>>
** 2. Cross-tenant supplier network <<amber>>
*** Unproven with about 100 buyers; vendors must stay free to keep the loop <<note>>
** 3. Referral finance: PO, invoice, guarantees <<red>>
*** Legal via a licensed partner, but only about SAR 1M to 2M a year <<note>>
*** Rails exist (Etimad, BwaTech, Wthaq); lenders are funded <<note>>
*** Reference App already partnered with Lendo (June 2026) <<note>>
** 4. Local content evidence <<red>>
*** Reference App inside SAP Ariba since July 2026 <<note>>
*** Private buyers have no legal duty <<note>>
** Alternative: become the lender <<amber>>
*** Venture-scale, but a different company: SAMA licence, SAR 5M+ capital, credit team <<note>>
